==Trivia==
*Gen.G and [[Sentinels]] were the oldest (average 23.4) roster at [[VCT/2024/Stage_1/Masters|VALORANT Masters Madrid 2024]]. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FionnOnFire/status/1767463950889959857|title=Average ages of the teams competing at VCT Madrid Masters|date=2024-03-12|author=[[FionnOnFire]]}}</ref>
*They are the first Korean Organisation to reach a Grand Final of an international event, doing so at [[VCT/2024/Stage_1/Masters|VALORANT Masters Madrid 2024]].
*They are the first Pacific team to win an international event, that being [[VCT/2024/Stage_2/Masters|VALORANT Masters Shanghai 2024]].

